  "body": "In #2481 @zcorpan mentioned that chapters are not an implemented feature. Since the algorithm we have, as I discovered, also has some bugs, we should probably remove it in its entirety, including the corresponding text track kind and such.\r\n\r\nI filed https://github.com/w3c/webvtt/issues/344 on WebVTT since there's some text for chapters there as well.\r\n\r\nI'll leave this open for a bit so folks have a chance to weigh in should there be any concern.",
